			<div class="content" id="post-content-1888817">
									

<p>One thing I like here is that the sloths are barely <em>anomalous</em>. There's almost nothing here which is <em>100% scientifically impossible</em>, except for the whole 'interact with clouds' thing. But they were <em>bred</em> to do this.</p>
